{"completed": true, "response": "他很在乎一个亲近的人，这一刻突然更想和对方靠近，也意识到这份心意很重要。虽然还不知道该怎么做，但他隐约觉得，如果让对方更明显地感受到自己的在意，两人的关系就可能发生变化。他还没想清楚，就已经心动了，一边被对方吸引，一边又舍不得现在的关系发生改变。他不想放弃这份可能，但心里还没有足够的把握让自己安心。", "metadata": {"session_handle": "4770b88e-337e-4f58-9e8e-c8ce0606bd6c", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261023T003747223462Z", "elapsed_seconds": 5.312, "completed_utc": "2026-10-23T00:37:52.536235+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "cbc95246d9cf6adca843bc9f1630e77537b92b21bf70ac2603d737110b360dac", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "30cf31059194d34457cecf86ec06639767021c07b9a7cda0ca767614c0d702ad", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "eedfa23885000025700f6306b1d1f4582896a7370734be506c156dee532fd7d7"}}, "screenshot_evidence": {"complete": true, "kind": "offline_actual_HTTP_response", "directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261023T003747223462Z", "files": ["proof-offline.png"], "sha256": {"proof-offline.png": "1f343e9d